    └── hire_purchase.py           # Hire Purchase calculator (TODO)


📊 How It Works

File Upload

Upload an Excel file containing financing records
The app auto-detects the financing type based on the Product Group column:

CC = Credit Card
PL = Personal Financing
HP = Hire Purchase


Tab Navigation

1. Credit Card tab: Enabled when file contains CC records
2. Personal Financing tab: Enabled when file contains PL records
3. Hire Purchase tab: Enabled when file contains HP records
4. Tabs are automatically disabled if their financing type is not present in the uploaded file

Data Flow

1. Upload Excel → Detects Product Group → Enables relevant tabs
2. Select a tab → Filter data by Product Group (CC/PL/HP)
3. Search and select CIF → Display account data
4. Enter settlement details → Calculate matrix

📋 Required Columns
1. Credit Card (CC)
      * Account No
      * Product Group
      * CIF No.
      * Current O/S Balance
      * Current O/S Balance (Customer Level)
      * Write Off Date
      * Last Payment Amount
      * Total Write Off Amount

2. Personal Financing (PL) / Hire Purchase (HP)

      * Account No
      * Product Group
      * CIF No.
      * Misc Cost
      * Late/Compensation Charges
      * Memo Late/Compensation Charges
      * Other Charge
      * Payoff Amount
      * Current Balance
      * Islamic Flag
      * Write Off Date - Approved Date
      * Write Off IIS
      * O/S Balance Plus

✅ Implementation Status

 File upload and Product Group detection
 Tab navigation with auto-enable/disable
 CIF search and selection (shared across all types)
