Principal Outstanding  - Total Write Off Amount - EXCEL
Total Current Outstanding Balance - Current O/S Balance (Customer Level) - EXCEL
Proposed Settlement Type (Lump Sum / ATP) - INPUT (DROPDOWN)
Repayment Period - INPUT (DROPDOWN)
  a) Lump Sum
        - 1 month
        - 3 months
  b) ATP
        - < 2years
        - 2-5 years
        - >5-7 years
Waiver % on Interest - GENERATED
Waiver % in Fees paid by Bank - GENERATED
Operating cost (Principal > 0) @ 5.0p.a. x Fees paid by Bank  - GENERATED (EDITABLE)
Operating cost (Principal < 0) @ 5.0p.a. x Fees paid by Bank  - GENERATED (EDITABLE)
Proposed Settlement Amount - INPUT (FIELD)
Bank Settlement Matrix (Amount) - GENERATED
As Per Bank Matrix (Yes /No) - GENERATED


*************EXTRA KNOWLEDGE***************
Write off amount - charge off amt
Net charge off = used amt - paid amount

1 lump sum amt - both interest is 0
Principal - right column is empty 
Without principal - left column is empty
*******************************************


Total Interest =  current_os_balance - principal_outstanding
Projected Interest (60%) 	 = from Total Interest
Projected Late Fee (30%) 	 = from Total Interest
Projected Fees paid by Bank (10%)  = from Total Interest
Waiver % in Late Charges = static 100
Waiver in Princpal = static 0
Operating cost (Principal > 0) @ 5.0p.a. x Fees paid by Bank 	 
Operating cost (Principal < 0) @ 5.0p.a. x Fees paid by Bank 
